{"route":"/docs/5.3/components/progress/","version":"5.3","renderedVersion":"5.3","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Progress","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Documentation and examples for using Bootstrap custom progress bars featuring support for stacked bars, animated backgrounds, and text labels."},"blocks":[{"id":"content--note-1","type":"note","tone":"info","body":[{"id":"content--note-text-1","type":"note-text","en":"<strong>New markup in v5.3.0 —</strong> We’ve deprecated the previous HTML structure for progress bars and replaced it with a more accessible one. The previous structure will continue to work until v6. <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/migration#improved-markup-for-progress-bars\">See what’s changed in our migration guide.</a>"}]},{"id":"how-it-works","type":"heading","en":"How it works","level":2},{"id":"how-it-works--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Progress components are built with two HTML elements, some CSS to set the width, and a few attributes. We don’t use <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/progress\">the HTML5 <code>&lt;progress&gt;</code> element</a>, ensuring you can stack progress bars, animate them, and place text labels over them."},{"id":"how-it-works--list-1","type":"list","tag":"ul","items":[{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-it-works--item-1","type":"item","en":"We use the <code>.progress</code> as a wrapper to indicate the max value of the progress bar."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-it-works--item-2","type":"item","en":"The <code>.progress</code> wrapper also requires a <code>role=&quot;progressbar&quot;</code> and <code>aria</code> attributes to make it accessible, including an accessible name (using <code>aria-label</code>, <code>aria-labelledby</code>, or similar)."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-it-works--item-3","type":"item","en":"We use the inner <code>.progress-bar</code> purely for the visual bar and label."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-it-works--item-4","type":"item","en":"The <code>.progress-bar</code> requires an inline style, utility class, or custom CSS to set its width."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-it-works--item-5","type":"item","en":"We provide a special <code>.progress-stacked</code> class to create multiple/stacked progress bars."}]}]},{"id":"how-it-works--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Put that all together, and you have the following examples."},{"id":"how-it-works--example-1","type":"demo","key":"de0efa9bc3323016f447","height":300},{"id":"how-it-works--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" aria-valuenow=\"0\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: 0%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: 25%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" aria-valuenow=\"50\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: 50%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: 75%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" aria-valuenow=\"100\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: 100%\"></div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"bar-sizing","type":"heading","en":"Bar sizing","level":2},{"id":"width","type":"heading","en":"Width","level":3},{"id":"width--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Bootstrap provides a handful of <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/utilities/sizing\">utilities for setting width</a>. Depending on your needs, these may help with quickly configuring the width of the <code>.progress-bar</code>."},{"id":"width--example-1","type":"demo","key":"8accc4bf274aa701f88a","height":147},{"id":"width--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar w-75\"></div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"height","type":"heading","en":"Height","level":3},{"id":"height--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"You only set a <code>height</code> value on the <code>.progress</code> container, so if you change that value, the inner <code>.progress-bar</code> will automatically resize accordingly."},{"id":"height--example-1","type":"demo","key":"8ffc093234f95bb1d00d","height":174},{"id":"height--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Example 1px high\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" style=\"height: 1px\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: 25%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Example 20px high\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" style=\"height: 20px\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: 25%\"></div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"labels","type":"heading","en":"Labels","level":2},{"id":"labels--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add labels to your progress bars by placing text within the <code>.progress-bar</code>."},{"id":"labels--example-1","type":"demo","key":"f7ec9b03fba151a6967e","height":147},{"id":"labels--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Example with label\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: 25%\">25%</div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"long-labels","type":"heading","en":"Long labels","level":3},{"id":"long-labels--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Note that by default, the content inside the <code>.progress-bar</code> is controlled with <code>overflow: hidden</code>, so it doesn’t bleed out of the bar. If your progress bar is shorter than its label, the content will be capped and may become unreadable. To change this behavior, you can use <code>.overflow-visible</code> from the <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/utilities/overflow\">overflow utilities</a>."},{"id":"long-labels--note-1","type":"note","tone":"warning","body":[{"id":"long-labels--note-text-1","type":"note-text","en":"Labels longer than the progress bar within may not be fully accessible using this method because it relies on the text color having the correct contrast ratio with both the <code>.progress</code> and <code>.progress-bar</code> background colors. Use caution when implementing this example."},{"id":"long-labels--note-text-2","type":"note-text","en":"If the text can overlap the progress bar, we often recommend displaying the label outside of the progress bar for better accessibility."}]},{"id":"backgrounds","type":"heading","en":"Backgrounds","level":2},{"id":"backgrounds--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use background utility classes to change the appearance of individual progress bars."},{"id":"backgrounds--example-1","type":"demo","key":"6c1fba13827193e8b2b2","height":228},{"id":"backgrounds--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Success example\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-success\" style=\"width: 25%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Info example\" aria-valuenow=\"50\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-info\" style=\"width: 50%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Warning example\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-warning\" style=\"width: 75%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Danger example\" aria-valuenow=\"100\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-danger\" style=\"width: 100%\"></div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"backgrounds--note-1","type":"note","tone":"info","body":[{"id":"backgrounds--note-text-1","type":"note-text","en":"<strong>Accessibility tip:</strong> Using color to add meaning only provides a visual indication, which will not be conveyed to users of assistive technologies like screen readers. Please ensure the meaning is obvious from the content itself (e.g., the visible text with a <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/accessibility/#color-contrast\"><em>sufficient</em> color contrast</a>) or is included through alternative means, such as additional text hidden with the <code>.visually-hidden</code> class."}]},{"id":"backgrounds--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"If you’re adding labels to progress bars with a custom background color, make sure to also set an appropriate <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/utilities/colors#colors\">text color</a>, so the labels remain readable and have sufficient contrast. We recommend using the <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/helpers/color-background\">color and background</a> helper classes."},{"id":"backgrounds--example-2","type":"demo","key":"51a11d0282f7d7259e4d","height":228},{"id":"backgrounds--code-2","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Success example\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar text-bg-success\" style=\"width: 25%\">25%</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Info example\" aria-valuenow=\"50\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar text-bg-info\" style=\"width: 50%\">50%</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Warning example\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar text-bg-warning\" style=\"width: 75%\">75%</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Danger example\" aria-valuenow=\"100\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar text-bg-danger\" style=\"width: 100%\">100%</div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"multiple-bars","type":"heading","en":"Multiple bars","level":2},{"id":"multiple-bars--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"You can include multiple progress components inside a container with <code>.progress-stacked</code> to create a single stacked progress bar. Note that in this case, the styling to set the visual width of the progress bar <em>must</em> be applied to the <code>.progress</code> elements, rather than the <code>.progress-bar</code>s."},{"id":"multiple-bars--example-1","type":"demo","key":"5463770c28bc2c06611c","height":147},{"id":"multiple-bars--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"progress-stacked\">\n  <div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Segment one\" aria-valuenow=\"15\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" style=\"width: 15%\">\n    <div class=\"progress-bar\"></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Segment two\" aria-valuenow=\"30\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" style=\"width: 30%\">\n    <div class=\"progress-bar bg-success\"></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Segment three\" aria-valuenow=\"20\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" style=\"width: 20%\">\n    <div class=\"progress-bar bg-info\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"striped","type":"heading","en":"Striped","level":2},{"id":"striped--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add <code>.progress-bar-striped</code> to any <code>.progress-bar</code> to apply a stripe via CSS gradient over the progress bar’s background color."},{"id":"striped--example-1","type":"demo","key":"dfc616872213467f3f98","height":300},{"id":"striped--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Default striped example\" aria-valuenow=\"10\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped\" style=\"width: 10%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Success striped example\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped bg-success\" style=\"width: 25%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Info striped example\" aria-valuenow=\"50\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped bg-info\" style=\"width: 50%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Warning striped example\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped bg-warning\" style=\"width: 75%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Danger striped example\" aria-valuenow=\"100\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped bg-danger\" style=\"width: 100%\"></div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"animated-stripes","type":"heading","en":"Animated stripes","level":2},{"id":"animated-stripes--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"The striped gradient can also be animated. Add <code>.progress-bar-animated</code> to <code>.progress-bar</code> to animate the stripes right to left via CSS3 animations."},{"id":"animated-stripes--example-1","type":"demo","key":"3daebc935c4e9cfcc00c","height":147},{"id":"animated-stripes--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Animated striped example\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped progress-bar-animated\" style=\"width: 75%\"></div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"css","type":"heading","en":"CSS","level":2},{"id":"variables","type":"heading","en":"Variables","level":3},{"id":"variables--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<small>Added in v5.2.0</small>"},{"id":"variables--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"As part of Bootstrap’s evolving CSS variables approach, progress bars now use local CSS variables on <code>.progress</code> for enhanced real-time customization. Values for the CSS variables are set via Sass, so Sass customization is still supported, too."},{"id":"variables--code-1","type":"code","value":"--#{$prefix}progress-height: #{$progress-height};\n@include rfs($progress-font-size, --#{$prefix}progress-font-size);\n--#{$prefix}progress-bg: #{$progress-bg};\n--#{$prefix}progress-border-radius: #{$progress-border-radius};\n--#{$prefix}progress-box-shadow: #{$progress-box-shadow};\n--#{$prefix}progress-bar-color: #{$progress-bar-color};\n--#{$prefix}progress-bar-bg: #{$progress-bar-bg};\n--#{$prefix}progress-bar-transition: #{$progress-bar-transition};","language":"scss"},{"id":"sass-variables","type":"heading","en":"Sass variables","level":3},{"id":"sass-variables--code-1","type":"code","value":"$progress-height:                   1rem;\n$progress-font-size:                $font-size-base * .75;\n$progress-bg:                       var(--#{$prefix}secondary-bg);\n$progress-border-radius:            var(--#{$prefix}border-radius);\n$progress-box-shadow:               var(--#{$prefix}box-shadow-inset);\n$progress-bar-color:                $white;\n$progress-bar-bg:                   $primary;\n$progress-bar-animation-timing:     1s linear infinite;\n$progress-bar-transition:           width .6s ease;","language":"scss"},{"id":"keyframes","type":"heading","en":"Keyframes","level":3},{"id":"keyframes--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Used for creating the CSS animations for <code>.progress-bar-animated</code>. Included in <code>scss/_progress-bar.scss</code>."},{"id":"keyframes--code-1","type":"code","value":"@if $enable-transitions {\n  @keyframes progress-bar-stripes {\n    0% { background-position-x: var(--#{$prefix}progress-height); }\n  }\n}","language":"scss"}],"demos":[{"key":"de0efa9bc3323016f447","html":" <div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" aria-valuenow=\"0\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: 0%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: 25%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" aria-valuenow=\"50\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: 50%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: 75%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" aria-valuenow=\"100\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: 100%\"></div>\n</div> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""},{"key":"8accc4bf274aa701f88a","html":" <div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar w-75\"></div>\n</div> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""},{"key":"8ffc093234f95bb1d00d","html":" <div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Example 1px high\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" style=\"height: 1px\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: 25%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Example 20px high\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" style=\"height: 20px\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: 25%\"></div>\n</div> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""},{"key":"f7ec9b03fba151a6967e","html":" <div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Example with label\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: 25%\">25%</div>\n</div> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""},{"key":"6c1fba13827193e8b2b2","html":" <div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Success example\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-success\" style=\"width: 25%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Info example\" aria-valuenow=\"50\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-info\" style=\"width: 50%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Warning example\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-warning\" style=\"width: 75%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Danger example\" aria-valuenow=\"100\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-danger\" style=\"width: 100%\"></div>\n</div> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""},{"key":"51a11d0282f7d7259e4d","html":" <div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Success example\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar text-bg-success\" style=\"width: 25%\">25%</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Info example\" aria-valuenow=\"50\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar text-bg-info\" style=\"width: 50%\">50%</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Warning example\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar text-bg-warning\" style=\"width: 75%\">75%</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Danger example\" aria-valuenow=\"100\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar text-bg-danger\" style=\"width: 100%\">100%</div>\n</div> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""},{"key":"5463770c28bc2c06611c","html":" <div class=\"progress-stacked\">\n  <div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Segment one\" aria-valuenow=\"15\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" style=\"width: 15%\">\n    <div class=\"progress-bar\"></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Segment two\" aria-valuenow=\"30\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" style=\"width: 30%\">\n    <div class=\"progress-bar bg-success\"></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Segment three\" aria-valuenow=\"20\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" style=\"width: 20%\">\n    <div class=\"progress-bar bg-info\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""},{"key":"dfc616872213467f3f98","html":" <div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Default striped example\" aria-valuenow=\"10\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped\" style=\"width: 10%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Success striped example\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped bg-success\" style=\"width: 25%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Info striped example\" aria-valuenow=\"50\" aria-valu